(7560522, 1212050, 103032, '<td valign="top">Wow!  That''s a crazy monsoon.  This is a great photo of the human element affected by weather.  Great focus on the two young ladies.  I love their smiles/laughter of getting caught up in the drenching downpour.  My favorite for this challenge.</td>', 'Wow!  That''s a crazy monsoon.  This is a great photo of the human element affected by weather.  Great focus on the two young ladies.  I love their smiles/laughter of getting caught up in the drenching downpour.  My favorite for this challenge.', '2018-02-23 02:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560523, 1212106, 103032, '<td valign="top">Crazy natural ice sculptures.  Love the tone; feels bone chilling cold.</td>', 'Crazy natural ice sculptures.  Love the tone; feels bone chilling cold.', '2018-02-23 02:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560648, 1211996, 65234, '<td valign="top">If that''s a yellow jacket, I''m not sad. Nasty little bugs. Of course if the weather there is anything like here (bouncing back and forth between warm and cold with dizzying speed) the bug was likely just not quick enough to adapt to change. Like many humans.<br/> <br/>Also, the image is well done.</td>', 'If that''s a yellow jacket, I''m not sad. Nasty little bugs. Of course if the weather there is anything like here (bouncing back and forth between warm and cold with dizzying speed) the bug was likely just not quick enough to adapt to change. Like many humans. Also, the image is well done.', '2018-02-24 09:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560649, 1212093, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the mood this creates. It FEELS damp!</td>', 'Love the mood this creates. It FEELS damp!', '2018-02-24 09:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560650, 1212037, 65234, '<td valign="top">Good subject; light seems a bit harsh to me.</td>', 'Good subject; light seems a bit harsh to me.', '2018-02-24 09:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560652, 1212094, 65234, '<td valign="top">That''s one heck of a subject for this challenge! Gorgeous, cold, wonderfully abandoned.</td>', 'That''s one heck of a subject for this challenge! Gorgeous, cold, wonderfully abandoned.', '2018-02-24 09:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560653, 1212055, 65234, '<td valign="top">Truly stunning to see the tree growing over the top of the building. I would probably try to crop out the people, even though I would lose some of the tree.</td>', 'Truly stunning to see the tree growing over the top of the building. I would probably try to crop out the people, even though I would lose some of the tree.', '2018-02-24 09:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560654, 1212095, 65234, '<td valign="top">That just goes on forever! It''s depressing, but interesting nonetheless. Well captured.</td>', 'That just goes on forever! It''s depressing, but interesting nonetheless. Well captured.', '2018-02-24 09:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560655, 1211553, 65234, '<td valign="top">Fabulous sense of isolation. Love the drama in the sky, too.</td>', 'Fabulous sense of isolation. Love the drama in the sky, too.', '2018-02-24 09:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560659, 1211905, 65234, '<td valign="top">That looks dangerous. Not sure what I think about the color cast. I (being an unimaginative type) expect a blue color cast, if any, to a winter scene. Maybe the leaves draw the eye to the tree more this way? I still think I''d pull the saturation back on yellow.</td>', 'That looks dangerous. Not sure what I think about the color cast. I (being an unimaginative type) expect a blue color cast, if any, to a winter scene. Maybe the leaves draw the eye to the tree more this way? I still think I''d pull the saturation back on yellow.', '2018-02-24 10:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560660, 1211760, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love that perfect spotlight on the tub. Great subject.</td>', 'Love that perfect spotlight on the tub. Great subject.', '2018-02-24 10:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560661, 1212079, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oooh, that''s cool (pun intended)! A similar phenomenon happened near me but of course I only heard about it later. I must learn to explore more in the early hours.</td>', 'Oooh, that''s cool (pun intended)! A similar phenomenon happened near me but of course I only heard about it later. I must learn to explore more in the early hours.', '2018-02-24 10:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560662, 1211804, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the board, but the flowers take a lot away from that, IMO. I realize it''s a contrast of old and new but the board just gets lost to my eye, and especially for this challenge that doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'I like the board, but the flowers take a lot away from that, IMO. I realize it''s a contrast of old and new but the board just gets lost to my eye, and especially for this challenge that doesn''t work for me.', '2018-02-24 10:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560663, 1211711, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting old place. Looks just a tad out of focus to me, or maybe not enough DOF.</td>', 'Interesting old place. Looks just a tad out of focus to me, or maybe not enough DOF.', '2018-02-24 10:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560664, 1212101, 65234, '<td valign="top">She looks exasperated LOL. Great capture.</td>', 'She looks exasperated LOL. Great capture.', '2018-02-24 10:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7560665, 1212083, 65234, '<td valign="top">Those are wonderful!</td>', 'Those are wonderful!', '2018-02-24 10:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
