(7560667, 1212075, 65234, '<td valign="top">Seems so weird to see it unconnected to anything but the water. Lovely colors here, and the misty sort of effect from the long exposure works well.</td>', 'Seems so weird to see it unconnected to anything but the water. Lovely colors here, and the misty sort of effect from the long exposure works well.', '2018-02-24 10:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
