(7561184, 1212106, 135744, '<td valign="top">No need to comb the archives when you have fresh photos like this. Be curious to know where this was taken. Congrats on TT</td>', 'No need to comb the archives when you have fresh photos like this. Be curious to know where this was taken. Congrats on TT', '2018-02-28 11:19:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7561284, 1211834, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>Great image Janine. Derelict buildings make tremendous subjects as indeed this is here, it looks like an old jail, hence the title, there must have been a lot of anxiety amongst those incarcerated within its walls. The composition is excellent from the stairs leading down on the right with the far doorway and corridor leading you into the depth of the building, it works well. Good DOF, the open door on the left adds to the sense of abandonment, I like it all, well done Janine.<br/> <br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2018-03-01 06:31:28.</i></td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge Great image Janine. Derelict buildings make tremendous subjects as indeed this is here, it looks like an old jail, hence the title, there must have been a lot of anxiety amongst those incarcerated within its walls. The composition is excellent from the stairs leading down on the right with the far doorway and corridor leading you into the depth of the building, it works well. Good DOF, the open door on the left adds to the sense of abandonment, I like it all, well done Janine. ', '2018-03-01 06:29:06.000000', '2018-03-01 06:31:28.000000', 0),
(7561285, 1211590, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>Great image Drake. I like it for all the same reasons you have identified in your comments, it works well. My only criticism would be that I feel it is too tightly cropped on the right, it would be good to have some ''breathing'' space to look into. The exposure is good with nice crisp white snow as opposed to the usual grey from insufficient exposure. Well done.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge Great image Drake. I like it for all the same reasons you have identified in your comments, it works well. My only criticism would be that I feel it is too tightly cropped on the right, it would be good to have some ''breathing'' space to look into. The exposure is good with nice crisp white snow as opposed to the usual grey from insufficient exposure. Well done.', '2018-03-01 06:35:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7561286, 1211604, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>Congratulations for the HM Anton. The subject is most appropriate, derelict, abandoned and very weathered it fulfils the challenge brief well. You have added atmosphere to it with your post-processing of the surroundings. However, selection inaccuracies have made it rather too obvious for me to disregard it, which is rather a shame given the nature of the original study.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge Congratulations for the HM Anton. The subject is most appropriate, derelict, abandoned and very weathered it fulfils the challenge brief well. You have added atmosphere to it with your post-processing of the surroundings. However, selection inaccuracies have made it rather too obvious for me to disregard it, which is rather a shame given the nature of the original study.', '2018-03-01 06:45:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7561288, 1212050, 109227, '<td valign="top">This is terrific; you have captured the moment so well and the details tones are spot on.</td>', 'This is terrific; you have captured the moment so well and the details tones are spot on.', '2018-03-01 07:51:37.000000', NULL, 0),
